     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Hi everyone,</span></p><p style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">I run my model on Mplus and lavaan. Results are 99.99% similar except <b>SRMR in Mplus is .063</b> while in <b>lavaan is .045</b></span></p><p style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">I don’t know why they are different while other indices are identical.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"> </span></p><p style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">In lavaan, fitMeasures() even produces <b>srmr_mplus (.281)</b> and <b>srmr_mplus_nomean (.045).</b> Both are very much different with SRMR from Mplus.</span></p><p style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Thank you very much,</span></p><p style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(32,31,30)\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Dai</span></p></div>"
